OL,3,GNEWSAHousing delays cause schools
OL,4,A'significant challenges'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDelays to house building have been
OL,7,Fcited as a factor in three Rugby
OL,8,Fschools planning to reduce available
OL,9,Fplaces from September 2028.
OL,11,FWarwickshire County Council is set to
OL,12,Flaunch a consultation on school
OL,13,Fadmission arrangements for 2028,
OL,14,Fincluding the proposed cuts to places
OL,15,Fat Long Lawford Primary School, Bilton
OL,16,FInfant School, and Boughton Leigh
OL,17,FJunior School.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
