OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAHousing delays cause schools
OL,4,A'significant challenges'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe education authority puts the
OL,7,Freductions down to declining pupil
OL,8,Fnumbers that are expected to "persist
OL,9,Ffor several years", causing
OL,10,F"significant challenges" for schools.
OL,12,FKathryn Carey, the authority's
OL,13,Fadmissions technical lead, said the
OL,14,Fdelays meant "that housing previously
OL,15,Fexpected to be occupied by now is yet
OL,16,Fto be built".
